hadiths[15]{hadithnumber,text}:
"455","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talha se, unhon ne Aal-e-Shifa ke ghulam Rafi bin Ishaq se, jise Abu Talha ka ghulam kaha jata tha, riwayat kya ke unhon ne Ansari Abu Ayyub ko jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahabi they suna jab ke wo Misr mein they, kehte ke Allah ki qasam main nahi janta ke in pakhanon ke sath kya karun, jab ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi pakhana ya peshab ke liye jaye to apni sharmgah se qibla ki taraf munh na kare aur na us ki taraf pusht kare."
"456","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Ansar mein se aik shakhs se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke pakhana ya peshab ke liye qibla ki taraf munh kya jaye."
"457","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Yahya bin Hibban se, unhon ne apne chacha Wasi bin Hibban se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke kuchh log kehte hain ke jab tum apni haajat ke liye baitho to qibla ki taraf aur na Baitul Maqdis ki taraf munh karo. Abdullah ne kaha ke main apne aik ghar ki chhat par chadha aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko do eenton par apni haajat ke liye Baitul Maqdis ki taraf munh kiye dekha, phir kaha ke shayad tum un mein se ho jo apne sarinon par Namaz padhte hain. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kaha ke Allah ki qasam main nahi janta."
"458","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qibla ki deewar mein thook dekha to use khurach diya, phir logon ki taraf mutawajja hue aur farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi Namaz padh raha ho to apne chehre ke samne na thuke, kyunke Allah Tabarak wa Taala us ke chehre ke samne hota hai jab wo Namaz padhta hai."
"459","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)"
"460","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jab log Quba mein Fajr ki Namaz mein they to un ke paas aik aane wala aaya aur kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par aaj raat Quran nazil hua hai aur unhein hukm diya gaya hai ke Kaaba ki taraf munh karein, to us ki taraf munh karo, jab ke un ke chehre Sham ki taraf they, to wo Kaaba ki taraf ghoom gae."
"461","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Madina aane ke baad solah mahine Baitul Maqdis ki taraf Namaz padhi, phir qibla Badr se do mahine pehle pher diya gaya."
"462","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan qibla hai jab Baitullah ki taraf munh kya jaye."
"463","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Rabah aur Ubaidullah bin Abi Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah Abu Abdullah Salman Agharr se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri is masjid mein Namaz is ke siwa mein hazaar Namaz se behtar hai siwa Masjid-e-Haram ke."
"464","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Khubaib bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Hafs bin Asim se, unhon ne Abu Huraira ya Abu Saeed Khudri se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere ghar aur mere mimbar ke darmiyan Jannat ke baghon mein se aik bagh hai aur mera mimbar mere hauz par hai."
"465","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne Abbad bin Tamim se, unhon ne Mazni Abdullah bin Zaid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere ghar aur mere mimbar ke darmiyan Jannat ke baghon mein se aik bagh hai."
"466","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Abdullah bin Umar se khabar pahunchi ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ki bandiyon ko Allah ki masjidein na roko."
"467","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Busr bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi aurat Isha ki Namaz mein hazir ho to khushboo na lagae."
"468","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Umar bin Khattab ki biwi Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail ki beti Atika se riwayat kya ke wo Umar bin Khattab se masjid ki ijazat mangti to wo khamosh rehte, to wo kehti ke Allah ki qasam main zaroor niklungi magar ke tum mujhe roko. To wo unhein na rokte."
"469","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Amra bint Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke agar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) pate jo aurton ne naya kya hai to unhein masjidein rokte jaisa Bani Israeel ki aurton ko roka tha. Yahya bin Saeed ne kaha ke maine Amra se kaha ke kya Bani Israeel ki aurton ko masjidein roki gain thin, unhon ne kaha ke haan."
